      {
        "id": 227715,
        "name": "Windfall",
        "username": "Windfall",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/windfall/{size}/1926_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-01T07:35:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks! Just from the Letters Page I could tell that Sentinel Comics&nbsp;has an awesome fan base. Did not disappoint :)<br>\n<br>\nI can't believe I didn't think of Heroic Luminary's incap side. The ONE hero in the whole game FROM the Inverted Universe. *facepalm*<br>\n<br>\nMy theory, btw, is that Legacy of Destruction uses the lantern symbol (which I now see he does, if a bit abstract interpretation) because just as Legacy's lantern connects him with Joseph Parsons and Paul Revere, LoD's lantern connects him with the Great Chicago Fire, which as legend has it, was started&nbsp;when a cow (or chaotic supervillian?!?!?!) kicked over a lantern in a barn. When I first heard of LoD, I immediately thought of that lantern and that the Parsons live in Chicago.<br>\n<br>\nCheers!</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:58.445Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 4,
        "readers_count": 3,
        "score": 0.8,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 19227,
        "topic_slug": "legacy-of-destruction-card",
        "display_username": "Windfall",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Thanks! Just from the Letters Page I could tell that Sentinel Comics&nbsp;has an awesome fan base. Did not disappoint :)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI can't believe I didn't think of Heroic Luminary's incap side. The ONE hero in the whole game FROM the Inverted Universe. *facepalm*<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMy theory, btw, is that Legacy of Destruction uses the lantern symbol (which I now see he does, if a bit abstract interpretation) because just as Legacy's lantern connects him with Joseph Parsons and Paul Revere, LoD's lantern connects him with the Great Chicago Fire, which as legend has it, was started&nbsp;when a cow (or chaotic supervillian?!?!?!) kicked over a lantern in a barn. When I first heard of LoD, I immediately thought of that lantern and that the Parsons live in Chicago.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCheers!</p>",
